# headless: the saved game the powerkill session (DOS's golden) starts from. A new character,
# as the newgame session makes one (every default, the name avatar); then a test's cheats
# (EXHUME_TEST_CHEATS=1; recording format 6): attack and barehand skills 30, strength 30,
# and the player moved to level 6, (45,60), beside a headless at (46,60): a powerful one
# (OBJ_POWERFUL), worth 162 experience (OBJECTS.DAT), with 11 hit points; Shift+D twice to
# face east, at it. Saved in slot I, described "kill"
9000 key esc
12000 key esc
15000 key enter        # Create Character
18000 key enter        # every default: sex, handedness, class, the skills, the portrait,
20000 key enter        # the difficulty
22000 key enter
24000 key enter
26000 key enter
28000 key enter
30000 key enter
32000 key enter
34000 key a            # the name
34200 key v
34400 key a
34600 key t
34800 key a
35000 key r
36000 key enter
38000 key enter        # Yes
44000 cheat set attack 30
44100 cheat set barehand 30
44200 cheat set str 30
44300 cheat goto 6 45 60
47000 down shift       # Shift+D twice: face east
47050 key d
47100 up shift
48000 down shift
48050 key d
48100 up shift
50000 down ctrl        # save: Ctrl+S, slot I, "kill"
50100 key s
50300 up ctrl
52000 key enter
53500 key k
53700 key i
53900 key l
54100 key l
55000 key enter
